WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.832
Learn to write a given problem as an equation in which a symbol is used to represent

00:00:05.832 --> 00:00:10.139
an unknown number and express a given pictorial or concrete representation of an

00:00:10.139 --> 00:00:11.464
equation in symbolic form

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:17.615
Kofi had some marbles. After receiving 33 more, he has 58. Which equation represents

00:00:17.615 --> 00:00:24.090
the unknown starting amount? The answer is n plus 33 equals 58. Let n be the marbles

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.233
at the start.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:31.597
Mansa had an unknown number of books; she receives 11 more and now owns 27. Which

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:36.465
equation models her original books n? Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:37.283 --> 00:00:43.407
The answer is n plus 11 equals 27. The original plus added books equals the final

00:00:43.407 --> 00:00:43.790
total.
